            "description": {
              "value": "You were created from magic involving mirrors and still retain some ability to seek refuge in reflected illusions. You gain the Mirror's Trickery reaction.\n\n**Mirror's Trickery**\nActivate (Reaction)\nFrequency: once per day\nTrigger: You would be hit by a Strike\nYou create an illusory duplicate at the last instant and attempt to trick your foe into striking it instead of you. The attacker attempts a DC 11 flat check; on a failure, the attack hits the duplicate, changing the result from a critical success to a success or a success to a failure."
            }
          }
        }
